+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Support — Donkey Trump 3D</title><style>html{color-scheme:dark light}body{font:1.1rem/1.65 system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:52rem;margin:auto;padding:1.5rem}a{color:#5275ef}nav{display:flex;gap:1.2rem;flex-wrap:wrap}h1,h2{line-height:1.2}li{margin:.5rem 0}footer{border-top:1px solid #888;margin-top:2rem;padding-top:1rem}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #e89c00;outline-offset:4px}</style></head><body><nav aria-label="Main"><a href="/support">Support</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></nav><main><h1>Donkey Trump 3D Support</h1><p>Support and operation: <strong>Jesper Bjerre</strong>.</p>
+<h2>Contact</h2><p><a href="https://github.com/jesper-bjerre/Donkey-Trump-3D/issues/new">Contact Jesper through the game's GitHub Issues</a>. GitHub requires an account to post. Issues are public: do not post personal details, private report contents or installation credentials. For a private matter, ask for private contact without including those details.</p>
+<h2>Playing the game</h2><p>Climb the girders, dodge barrels and reach Motzfeldt. Move and climb with the touch controls; use Jump to clear hazards. Play in landscape. Installed gameplay works without an internet connection.</p>
+<p>Sound and Haptics can be changed from the menu. With Sound enabled and audible volume, game audio plays even when the iPhone's silent switch is on.</p>
+<h2>Highscores</h2><p>The online list holds the top 100 results. Low-scoring cartoon starters keep at least ten entries available. Publishing a result is optional: enter a name and tap Submit. Names and scores on the list are public. There is no player login and no queued upload after a failed connection. Your personal best stays on your iPhone.</p>
+<h2>Report a name</h2><p>Tap the flag beside an entry, choose a reason and tap Send Report. My Reports lets you explicitly check a receipt's status. Jesper Bjerre checks reports every working day and is responsible for responding by the same local time on the next Monday–Friday working day in Europe/Copenhagen.</p>
+<p>An offensive entry can be removed and its app installation blocked from publishing further results, including under a different name. Local play and reporting remain available. Older results may lack an attributable installation and can only be removed. Reinstalling can reset an installation block; scores are not verified game replays.</p>
+<p>If a response is lost, the report or score may already have been saved. Check Status for a report or refresh the list for a score. A missing or expired receipt does not prove that no earlier report was saved. If the reporting service is unavailable, use the contact link above.</p>
+<h2>Privacy and removal</h2><p>Read the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> for stored information, retention and removal. You can report an entry containing personal information directly in the app.</p></main><footer>Donkey Trump 3D · Jesper Bjerre · Updated 27 September 2026<br>An original satirical parody. Not affiliated with any game publisher or politician.</footer></body></html>
